### Hotel Offer Orchestrator - API Tests
### REST Client extension: har request ke upar "Send Request" link dikhega, usko click karo
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Supplier A - Raw Hotels (Delhi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplierA/hotels?city=delhi

### 3. Supplier B - Raw Hotels (Delhi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplierB/hotels?city=delhi

### 4. Get Hotels - Valid City with Overlaps (Delhi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?city=delhi

### 5. Get Hotels - City With No Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?city=nowhere

### 6. Get Hotels - Missing City Param (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels

### 7. Get Hotels - Filtered by Price Range (Delhi, 5000-10000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?city=delhi&minPrice=5000&maxPrice=10000

### 8. Get Hotels - Mumbai (Overlap Set 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?city=mumbai

### 9. Get Hotels - Goa (Overlap Set 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?city=goa
